# Window close button: open System > About (dialog at x=14 y=7 w=52 h=9,
# its × is at (64,7)), click the × to close it, then click the Command
# window's × at (76,15) to hide it (Ctrl+F2 / Window > Command reopens).
mouse press 2 0 1
mouse release 2 0 1
mouse press 3 2 1
mouse release 3 2 1
mouse press 64 7 1
mouse release 64 7 1
mouse press 76 15 1
mouse release 76 15 1
eof
